## Open questions

- **Entropy threshold**: 2.0 is a placeholder. No calibration data in the survey. Will need empirical tuning against real repos — easy to adjust (single const).
- **Hidden coupling 80% tier**: The survey mentions severity escalation at both 65% and 80%, but the health system only has Advisory and Informational. Currently 65%+ → Advisory, 50-65% → Informational. The 80% tier could be reflected in the detail string or confidence, but has no scoring effect beyond Advisory. Revisit if a third severity level is added.
